# @s = rig anchor (the boss body, on the floor under the centre of the four feet), positioned and rotated where the
# boss should appear. Kills old parts, summons the 46 parts in the rest pose (+ the shadow helper), queues rest and
# re-applies the stored element looks (azRigLegs, azRigTail) and the body state (azRigState).
function rlk:mboss/azhdaha/rig/init
function rlk:mboss/azhdaha/rig/kill
execute unless score @s azRigLegs matches 0..2 run scoreboard players set @s azRigLegs 0
execute unless score @s azRigTail matches 0..2 run scoreboard players set @s azRigTail 0
execute unless score @s azRigState matches 0..2 run scoreboard players set @s azRigState 0
